Error [jet.UnsupportedDecimalOperator]: `%` isn't defined between `Decimal` and `Decimal`
  --> tests/ui/decimal_unsupported_operator.jet:6:11
    |
  6 |     print(price % tax)
    |           ^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `Decimal` supports `+`, `-`, `*`, `/` (giving a `Fraction`), and `==`/`!=`; `Fraction` and `Complex` support only their declared exact operations
 Fix: Use a named exact constructor or make both operands the same precise type
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0133
